{"logId": "df04cad2-51b8-4dd8-937e-3c9bc3b0cd08", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——健康", "block_bbox": [311, 120, 735, 164], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 120.0], [735.0, 120.0], [735.0, 164.0], [311.0, 164.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：懂得健康的原理，身体与情绪相互之间的影响作用，避免造成严重的痛苦或不可挽回的身心伤害。", "block_bbox": [308, 230, 1536, 308], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[308.0, 230.0], [1536.0, 230.0], [1536.0, 308.0], [308.0, 308.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：健康是生命中一切美好的基础和前提，做任何事情都不能以牺牲健康为代价，如果失去健康，无论身体、还是精神方面，都会给人造成极大的痛苦、无奈、甚至绝望。要懂得健康的原理，在懂得精神与身体之间相互作用的基础上，不让自己长期沉浸在精神痛苦中，也不过度透支身体、对身体造成不可挽回的后果。", "block_bbox": [307, 348, 1554, 518], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[307.0, 348.0], [1554.0, 348.0], [1554.0, 518.0], [307.0, 518.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [310, 579, 482, 611], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[310.0, 579.0], [482.0, 579.0], [482.0, 611.0], [310.0, 611.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、认知到健康的重要性", "block_bbox": [336, 637, 624, 669], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 637.0], [624.0, 637.0], [624.0, 669.0], [336.0, 669.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、懂得健康的原理，理解身体与情绪之间的相互影响作用，保证基本的精神健康和身体健康指标", "block_bbox": [334, 682, 1462, 715], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[334.0, 682.0], [1462.0, 682.0], [1462.0, 715.0], [334.0, 715.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、每年一次体检，根据体检结果和医生建议定期复查", "block_bbox": [335, 727, 966, 759], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 727.0], [966.0, 727.0], [966.0, 759.0], [335.0, 759.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、体重指数BMI在18~27.9范围内，不合格的在现有基础上保持或优化指标，不能偏离更多", "block_bbox": [336, 772, 1393, 805], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 772.0], [1393.0, 772.0], [1393.0, 805.0], [336.0, 805.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、任何情况下超过36小时，要主动睡觉休息，不透支身体", "block_bbox": [335, 817, 1022, 850], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[335.0, 817.0], [1022.0, 817.0], [1022.0, 850.0], [335.0, 850.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、有强烈的自我健康防护意识，注意个人及环境卫生、特殊情况及时接种疫苗等", "block_bbox": [337, 862, 1279, 895], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 862.0], [1279.0, 862.0], [1279.0, 895.0], [337.0, 895.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[96]", "block_bbox": [914, 968, 956, 993], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [955.0, 968.0], [955.0, 992.0], [914.0, 992.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7886261940002441, "coordinate": [311, 120, 735, 164], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 120.0], [735.0, 120.0], [735.0, 164.0], [311.0, 164.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6591135263442993, "coordinate": [308, 230, 1536, 308], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[308.0, 230.0], [1536.0, 230.0], [1536.0, 308.0], [308.0, 308.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.952279806137085, "coordinate": [307, 348, 1554, 518], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[307.0, 348.0], [1554.0, 348.0], [1554.0, 518.0], [307.0, 518.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7586046457290649, "coordinate": [310, 579, 482, 611], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[310.0, 579.0], [482.0, 579.0], [482.0, 611.0], [310.0, 611.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7858983874320984, "coordinate": [336, 637, 624, 669], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 637.0], [624.0, 637.0], [624.0, 669.0], [336.0, 669.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7892728447914124, "coordinate": [334, 682, 1462, 715], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[334.0, 682.0], [1462.0, 682.0], [1462.0, 715.0], [334.0, 715.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7754993438720703, "coordinate": [335, 727, 966, 759], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[335.0, 727.0], [966.0, 727.0], [966.0, 759.0], [335.0, 759.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8263456225395203, "coordinate": [336, 772, 1393, 805], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 772.0], [1393.0, 772.0], [1393.0, 805.0], [336.0, 805.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8280112147331238, "coordinate": [335, 817, 1022, 850], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[335.0, 817.0], [1022.0, 817.0], [1022.0, 850.0], [335.0, 850.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8299349546432495, "coordinate": [337, 862, 1279, 895], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 862.0], [1279.0, 862.0], [1279.0, 895.0], [337.0, 895.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7302553653717041, "coordinate": [914, 968, 956, 993], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [955.0, 968.0], [955.0, 992.0], [914.0, 992.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——健康\n\n## 一 级【0~1分】：懂得健康的原理，身体与情绪相互之间的影响作用，避免造成严重的痛苦或不可挽回的身心伤害。\n\n- 本条释义：健康是生命中一切美好的基础和前提，做任何事情都不能以牺牲健康为代价，如果失去健康，无论身体、还是精神方面，都会给人造成极大的痛苦、无奈、甚至绝望。要懂得健康的原理，在懂得精神与身体之间相互作用的基础上，不让自己长期沉浸在精神痛苦中，也不过度透支身体、对身体造成不可挽回的后果。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、认知到健康的重要性\n\n2、懂得健康的原理，理解身体与情绪之间的相互影响作用，保证基本的精神健康和身体健康指标\n\n3、每年一次体检，根据体检结果和医生建议定期复查\n\n4、体重指数BMI在18~27.9范围内，不合格的在现有基础上保持或优化指标，不能偏离更多\n\n5、任何情况下超过36小时，要主动睡觉休息，不透支身体\n\n6、有强烈的自我健康防护意识，注意个人及环境卫生、特殊情况及时接种疫苗等", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//df04cad2-51b8-4dd8-937e-3c9bc3b0cd08/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A47%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2Fbc6492ee83e77e8056a3da62377ef6baa4471b3707bb2484d1c2cb3c349829b7"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//df04cad2-51b8-4dd8-937e-3c9bc3b0cd08/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A47%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F586a36b7da8d9d1cfb0c6ed35b50f363dcd292c88a18fc2e819c0b7c1a23e312"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//df04cad2-51b8-4dd8-937e-3c9bc3b0cd08/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A47%3A32Z%2F-1%2F%2F926478210a7972864bf69bb295dea79ab88c75d9e244d8339d00ea53fc9eaea0"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
